+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: grouping the cubic clauses followed by GF(2) Gaussian "
+        "elimination solves the family in O(v*e*min(v,e)) bit operations; final "
+        "shipping measurements are recorded by selftest(), while the compact "
+        "spanning-tree route uses at most 2(v-1)+2 exact sign operations once the "
+        "hidden incidence decomposition is recognized."
